  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_first_00",
      "hash64": "7FD96AB20A9E1167",
      "text": "Bonjour tout le monde ! C’est un plaisir de\\nrencontrer les élèves de l’Institut Myrtille ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_first_01",
      "hash64": "7FD969B20A9E0FB4",
      "text": "Je m’appelle madame Thaïm.\\nApprenons ensemble en nous amusant ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "4FFAB60DD7961919",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)] ! J’ai entendu dire que tu étais\\nparti[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e étudier à l’Institut Myrtille.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "4FFAB50DD7961766",
      "text": "On m’a dit que tu étais passé[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e Maître[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0300)]sse, et que\\ntu apportais beaucoup de choses à cet institut ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0300"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 107,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "4FFAB40DD79615B3",
      "text": "C’est admirable !\\nJe suis très fière de ta réussite.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "4FFAB30DD7961400",
      "text": "N’hésite pas à me contacter, si tu as besoin\\nde quoi que ce soit.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 65,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "0560A4FB7B835A05",
      "text": "Madame Thaïm, j’ai besoin de vous !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "0560A1FB7B8354EC",
      "text": "Je n’hésiterai pas !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "4FFABA0DD7961FE5",
      "text": "Comment ? Déjà ?\\nTu ne perds pas de temps, hi hi ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 50,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp01_04b",
      "hash64": "7D29AC8554179265",
      "text": "J’apprécie beaucoup ton enthousiasme.\\nJ’ai hâte d’entendre de tes nouvelles ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "4FFAB90DD7961E32",
      "text": "J’imagine que tu dois être fort occupé[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e, entre\\ntes activités au club et tes aventures...\\r\\nMais n’oublie pas d’étudier de temps en temps.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "A92F74271EE73C26",
      "text": "Je sais que c’est soudain, mais je souhaite que\\ntu révises tes cours, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]. Allons-y ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "A92F75271EE73DD9",
      "text": "Hors cas particuliers, quel est le pourcentage\\nde chances de faire un coup critique ?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "7E29763B191ED428",
      "text": "Environ 1 %.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "7E29793B191ED941",
      "text": "Environ 4 %.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_select_03",
      "hash64": "7E29783B191ED78E",
      "text": "Environ 12 %.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "A92F72271EE738C0",
      "text": "Hi hi hi ! C’est faux, mais tu n’étais pas loin.\\nLa bonne réponse est : environ 4 %.\\r\\nTâche de le retenir pour la prochaine fois.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_02b",
      "hash64": "62D79A7982E53B46",
      "text": "Bravo ! C’est la bonne réponse !\\nJe te félicite, [VAR 0x0100(0000)] !\\r\\nTu as très bien retenu mes leçons ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "A92F73271EE73A73",
      "text": "À propos... je suis quelque peu préoccupée par\\nles élèves de l’Institut Myrtille.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "A92F78271EE742F2",
      "text": "Leur programme scolaire porte principalement\\nsur les combats Pokémon et la compétition...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "A92F79271EE744A5",
      "text": "Si ces connaissances leur permettent de vivre\\nde cette passion, pourquoi pas...[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_06",
      "hash64": "A92F76271EE73F8C",
      "text": "Mais que se passera-t-il, si leur rêve se brise ?\\nComment se reconvertir ?[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_07",
      "hash64": "A92F77271EE7413F",
      "text": "C’est pour cela que les autres matières comme\\nles mathématiques, l’éducation domestique\\r\\nou les langues sont importantes.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_08",
      "hash64": "A92F7C271EE749BE",
      "text": "Elles offrent un large choix de carrières, et\\nje pense que nous ne devrions pas les négliger.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_09",
      "hash64": "A92F7D271EE74B71",
      "text": "... Pardon, j’ai beaucoup parlé.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_select_04",
      "hash64": "7E297B3B191EDCA7",
      "text": "Ce n’est pas grave !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_select_05",
      "hash64": "7E297A3B191EDAF4",
      "text": "C’était intéressant !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp02_10",
      "hash64": "A932FA271EEA55AF",
      "text": "Hi hi ! Comme tu es gentil[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0200)]le ! Je vais continuer de\\ndonner le meilleur de moi-même pour les élèves ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0200"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 105,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "7D958A20BDDA2EB7",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)], merci encore de m’avoir\\nécoutée la dernière fois. C’était très gentil\\r\\nde ta part.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "7D958920BDDA2D04",
      "text": "Depuis, je suis allée rencontrer le directeur de\\nl’Institut Myrtille pour le sommer de consacrer\\r\\nplus de temps à l’apprentissage d’autres matières.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 150,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "CF14DDD21EF44623",
      "text": "Comment ça s’est passé ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "CF14DED21EF447D6",
      "text": "Quelle détermination !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "7D958C20BDDA321D",
      "text": "Il m’a dit qu’il ne pouvait pas changer le cursus\\nde base, mais qu’il pouvait tout à fait proposer\\r\\ndavantage de choix de matières optionnelles ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 147,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "7D958B20BDDA306A",
      "text": "En fait... s’il te fait appeler des intervenants,\\nc’est aussi dans cette optique de diversification.[VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0025"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_teacher_math_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "7D958620BDDA27EB",
      "text": "Je me rends compte à présent que j’ai bien mal\\njugé cet institut.\\c\\nHi hi hi, on dirait que je suis allée trop vite\\nen besogne ![VAR 0x0114(0025)]",
      "flags": 0,
